# Drizzle ORM

Follow `.cursor/skills/drizzle-orm/SKILL.md` when wiring Drizzle.

Hard rules:

- Drizzle schemas and `drizzle.config.ts` stay under `infrastructure/` — never in `domain/`
- Repository **ports** stay in domain; inject `DRIZZLE` only inside adapters
- Prefer `*.repository.adapter.ts` names (ORM-agnostic)
- Register `DrizzlePersistenceModule` from bootstrap
